Let me update orrery.toJSON():

```js
toJSON() {
  this.group.updateMatrixWorld(true);
  this.group.traverse((node) => node.updateMatrix());
  return this.group.toJSON();
}
```

updateMatrix sets this.matrix from position/quaternion/scale. Then serialization includes the composed matrix, and parse restores position via matrix.decompose. 

